es, legal, and shared services","position":{"start":{"line":101,"column":1},"end":{"line":101,"column":1}},"key":"slScKHR733"}],"key":"jchztTvqwM"}],"key":"BdZpk3T03U"},{"type":"listItem","spread":true,"position":{"start":{"line":102,"column":1},"end":{"line":102,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Technology and infrastructure: foundations, cloud, platforms, development, data, DevOps, and security","position":{"start":{"line":102,"column":1},"end":{"line":102,"column":1}},"key":"zmn27K1flz"}],"key":"aKZeumB75b"}],"key":"tZOs4PIVkk"},{"type":"listItem","spread":true,"position":{"start":{"line":103,"column":1},"end":{"line":103,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Programs and domains: research, engineering, robotics, biomedical, aerospace, and other specialized areas","position":{"start":{"line":103,"column":1},"end":{"line":103,"column":1}},"key":"K8xZPZgv6e"}],"key":"eYS7A0j5JM"}],"key":"XF3ZvmgUAK"},{"type":"listItem","spread":true,"position":{"start":{"line":104,"column":1},"end":{"line":105,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"People and services: team pages, ownership records, onboarding, support, and recurring operational workflows","position":{"start":{"line":104,"column":1},"end":{"line":104,"column":1}},"key":"KoYJqkLAAk"}],"key":"O0Oga3rhns"}],"key":"Wm1zw9Yj41"}],"key":"liu0YCMMQV"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":106,"column":1},"end":{"line":106,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"Pages should be designed for scanning and action. Use consistent names, short summaries, status or freshness indicators, clear owners, and links to the next useful action. A page should point to one canonical source rather than copying content into multiple hubs.","position":{"start":{"line":106,"column":1},"end":{"line":106,"column":1}},"key":"KyyOP0jrWw"}],"key":"JT5a3c2bWY"},{"type":"heading","depth":4,"position":